{"title":"Toilet-Bound Hanako-kun","overview":"*\"Hanako-san, Hanako-san... are you there?\"* \n\nAt Kamome Academy, rumors abound about the school's Seven Mysteries, one of which is Hanako-san. Said to occupy the third stall of the third floor girls' bathroom in the old school building, Hanako-san grants any wish when summoned. Nene Yashiro, an occult-loving high school girl who dreams of romance, ventures into this haunted bathroom... but the Hanako-san she meets there is nothing like she imagined! Kamome Academy's Hanako-san... is a boy! \n\n(Source: Yen Press)","year":2014,"status":"continuing","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Romance","School Life","Sci-Fi","Shounen","Supernatural","Tragedy"],"rating":8.4,"seriesType":"manga","metadata":{"images":[{"coverType":"poster","url":"/demo/MediaCover/0f1ebe45-354a-84dd-b8d5-bf8289b63248/poster-de4840d8d9.jpg","remoteUrl":"https://images.mangabaka.dev/6/a/f/6/3/5/b/3/76a1/4f7d/b999/d14c439f3227"}],"creators":[{"name":"AidaIro","roles":["storyAndArt"]}],"externalLinks":[{"name":"MangaBaka","externalId":"226","url":"https://mangabaka.org/manga/226/Toilet-Bound-Hanako-kun","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"155157","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/155157/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"155158","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/155158/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"Grand Comics Database","externalId":"201665","url":"https://www.comics.org/series/201665/","relationshipType":1},{"name":"AniList","externalId":"98842","url":"https://anilist.co/manga/98842","relationshipType":1},{"name":"pixiv Comic","externalId":"works/1562","url":"https://comic.pixiv.net/works/1562","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Wikipedia EN","externalId":"Toilet-Bound_Hanako-kun","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toilet-Bound_Hanako-kun","relationshipType":0},{"name":"Manga UP! Global","externalId":"132","url":"https://global.manga-up.com/manga/132","re